    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Morning Reminder Workflow\n\n**Purpose:** Sends daily workout reminders to users with scheduled workouts.\n\n**Schedule:** Runs at 5:00 AM (America/Bogota timezone)\n\n**Business Logic:**\n1. Queries `user_weekly_schedule` for today's uncompleted workouts\n2. Joins with `users` to get contact info\n3. Sends WhatsApp template reminder to each user\n\n**Template:** `prueba_2|es_CO` (Spanish - Colombia)",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        420
      ],
      "id": "sticky-purpose",
      "name": "workflow_documentation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Environment Configuration\n\n**TODO:** Move to environment variable:\n- `phoneNumberId`: 914510145083991\n\nThis should be configured via:\n`$env.WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID`",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        340
      ],
      "id": "sticky-env-note",
      "name": "env_config_note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error Handling\n\nCaptures workflow errors and logs them to database for monitoring.\n\n**Note:** Create the `n8n_workflow_errors` table if it doesn't exist.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1260,
        1060
      ],
      "id": "sticky-error-handling",
      "name": "error_handling_note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Empty Results\n\nGracefully handles days with no scheduled workouts.\nNo messages sent, no errors thrown.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 3
